"The change in `visitFunctionName(EsqlBaseParser.FunctionNameContext ctx)` now calls `metrics.function(name)`. Ensure that this call does not introduce any performance issues, especially if the function name resolution is expensive. Consider profiling this area if necessary.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java-28595:28650-28747:28814,28823:28846,28862:28866","promptId":"#277R9","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":28595,"endPos":28650,"startLine":624,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":624,"endLineOffset":70,"length":56}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":28747,"endPos":28814,"startLine":627,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":627,"endLineOffset":75,"length":68},{"pos":28823,"endPos":28846,"startLine":628,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":628,"endLineOffset":31,"length":24},{"pos":28862,"endPos":28866,"startLine":629,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":629,"endLineOffset":19,"length":5}]}]},{"comment":"The change from `metrics.commands().entrySet().forEach(x -\u003e incCommand(x.getKey(), x.getValue(), success));` to `metrics.commands().forEach((key, value) -\u003e incCommand(key, value, success));` and similarly for functions is more concise but relies on the assumption that `commands()` and `functions()` return a `Map`. If they were to change in the future to return something else (e.g., a custom collection type), this code would break. Ensure that these methods consistently return a `Map`.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/stats/PlanningMetricsManager.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/stats/PlanningMetricsManager.java-3073:3102,3111:3161,3172:3202,3211:3262-3073:3091,3